  {# ── Preview vs. production ──────────────────────────────────────── #}
  <section class="mt-12">
    <h2 class="text-display-xs font-semibold text-greyscale-900">Preview vs. production</h2>
    <p class="mt-4 text-greyscale-700 leading-relaxed">
      The preview is deliberately scoped — running it as a standalone site lets us validate the citator design and user experience, and gather expert feedback on the model's classifications, before committing to a full CourtListener integration.
    </p>
    <p class="mt-3 text-greyscale-700 leading-relaxed">
      Several things will look different in production:
    </p>

    <div class="mt-6 overflow-x-auto rounded-lg border border-greyscale-200">
