    <p class="mt-4 text-greyscale-700 leading-relaxed">
      If something feels missing or rough — a filter you'd reach for instinctively, a navigation shortcut you expect, a citator feature you can't find — we want to hear about it. Surfacing those reactions early is exactly what this preview is for.
    </p>
